From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] qemu-xilinx: guard sched_attr for glibc 2.41+

glibc 2.41 and newer defines struct sched_attr. Keep QEMU's fallback
definition for older glibc releases and non-glibc hosts.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Xilinx QEMU fork compatibility]
---
 linux-user/syscall.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/linux-user/syscall.c b/linux-user/syscall.c
--- a/linux-user/syscall.c
+++ b/linux-user/syscall.c
@@ -362,2 +362,4 @@
 /* sched_attr is not defined in glibc */
+#if !defined(__GLIBC__) || (__GLIBC__ < 2) || \
+    (__GLIBC__ == 2 && __GLIBC_MINOR__ < 41)
 struct sched_attr {
@@ -375,2 +377,3 @@
 };
+#endif
 #define __NR_sys_sched_getattr __NR_sched_getattr
